---
title: "Auction Lifecycle State Machine (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_active: initialize(publicKey, ...) called
    q_active --> q_refund: endTime reached
    q_refund --> q_init_results: refundEndTime reached
    q_init_results --> q_locked: initializePublishSaleResults() by operator
    q_locked --> q_results: publishSaleResults(privateKey) by operator
    q_results --> q_supply: supplyTokens() by projectAdmin
    q_supply --> q_distribution: tokens supplied
    q_distribution --> [*]: all tokens claimed; bids publicly verifiable

    q_active --> q_cancelled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_refund --> q_cancelled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_cancelled --> [*]: investors call withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled()

    note right of q_active
        INV-001: ECIES public key published at initialization
        INV-002: Investors submit encrypted bids during active period
        INV-003: Bid privacy maintained until private key release
    end note

    note right of q_locked
        INV-004: cancelLocked prevents cancellation after results initialization
        INV-005: Private key release enables public bid verification
        INV-006: Cancel impossible once initializePublishSaleResults is called
    end note
